{"title":"Windows 常见问题总结","date":"2024-08-21T16:00:00.000Z","toc":false,"summary":"","source":"_posts/操作系统/Windows/Windows 常见问题.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Windows 常见问题总结\ntags: [Windows, 操作系统]\nsummary: \"\"\ntoc: false\ncopyright: \"\"\ndate: 2024-08-22\n---\n\n## Windows 清理\n\n### 清理 WinSxS 文件夹\n\n在powershell窗口中输入命令：\n\n```powershell\ndism.exe /online /Cleanup-Image /StartComponentCleanup\n```\n\n\n\n## 让英文文件夹显示的是中文名称\n\ndesktop.ini 文件配置：\n\n[.ShellClassInfo]\nLocalizedResourceName=公共\n\n在上层文件夹中用cmd执行“attrib +s 文件夹名称”\n\n```CMD\nattrib +s 文件夹名称\n```\n\n## 删除启动项\n\n\n\n```cmd\n# 命令 BCDEDIT\nWindows 启动管理器\n--------------------\n标识符                  {bootmgr}\ndevice                  partition=\\Device\\HarddiskVolume9\npath                    \\EFI\\Microsoft\\Boot\\bootmgfw.efi\ndescription             Windows Boot Manager\nlocale                  zh-CN\ninherit                 {globalsettings}\ndefault                 {current}\nresumeobject            {907d43ff-8158-11ef-88fc-bf160908ff95}\ndisplayorder            {current}\n                        {88888866-7880-46de-8439-4fc3d0fb4ce6}\ntoolsdisplayorder       {memdiag}\ntimeout                 30\n\nWindows 启动加载器\n-------------------\n标识符                  {current}\ndevice                  partition=C:\npath                    \\Windows\\system32\\winload.efi\ndescription             Windows 10\nlocale                  zh-CN\ninherit                 {bootloadersettings}\nrecoverysequence        {5b7a3d51-03d5-11ef-95bc-d36910f8673c}\ndisplaymessageoverride  Recovery\nrecoveryenabled         Yes\nisolatedcontext         Yes\nallowedinmemorysettings 0x15000075\nosdevice                partition=C:\nsystemroot              \\Windows\nresumeobject            {5b7a3d4f-03d5-11ef-95bc-d36910f8673c}\nnx                      OptIn\nbootmenupolicy          Standard\n\nWindows 启动加载器\n-------------------\n标识符                  {88888866-7880-46de-8439-4fc3d0fb4ce6}\ndevice                  ramdisk=[C:]\\WEPE\\WEPE64.WIM,{888885bd-e62a-4d9f-b133-f2551f11e866}\npath                    \\windows\\system32\\boot\\winload.efi\ndescription             微 PE 工具箱\nosdevice                ramdisk=[C:]\\WEPE\\WEPE64.WIM,{888885bd-e62a-4d9f-b133-f2551f11e866}\nsystemroot              \\windows\nnx                      OptIn\npae                     ForceEnable\ndetecthal               Yes\nwinpe                   Yes\n\n```\n\n删除启动项\n\n```cmd\nbcdedit /delete {907d4400-8158-11ef-88fc-bf160908ff95}\n```\n\n\n\n## 怎么开机就执行 bat 文件\n\n### **方法一：将脚本放入「启动」文件夹**\n\n**特点**：简单快捷，但需用户登录后执行。\n​**​步骤​**​：\n\n1.  **打开启动文件夹**：\n    -   按 `Win + R`，输入 `shell:startup` 回车\n2.  **创建脚本快捷方式**：\n    -   将你的 `.bat` 文件**复制**到该文件夹，或右键选择「新建快捷方式」。\n    -   若需管理员权限，右键快捷方式 → **属性** → **高级** → 勾选 **用管理员身份运行**。\n\n------\n\n### **方法二：通过任务计划程序**\n\n**特点**：可设置开机自动执行（无需登录）、管理员权限、后台静默运行。\n​**​步骤​**​：\n\n1.  **打开任务计划程序**：\n    -   按 `Win + R`，输入 `taskschd.msc` 回车。\n2.  **创建新任务**：\n    -   右侧点击 **创建任务** → 输入名称（如 `AutoRun BAT`）。\n3.  **设置触发器**：\n    -   **新建** → 选择 **登录时** 或 **启动时**（启动时需管理员权限）。\n4.  **设置操作**：\n    -   **新建** → 操作选择 **启动程序** → 浏览选择你的 `.bat` 文件。\n    -   若需隐藏窗口：添加参数 `cmd /c \"你的脚本.bat\"`，并在 **起始于** 填写脚本所在目录。\n5.  **配置权限**：\n    -   **常规** → 勾选 **不管用户是否登录都要运行** 和 **使用最高权限**。\n6.  **保存任务** → 重启测试。\n\n------\n\n### **方法三：修改注册表**\n\n**特点**：直接写入系统启动项，但需谨慎操作。\n​**​步骤​**​：\n\n1.  按 `Win + R`，输入 `regedit` 回车。\n\n2.  导航到注册表路径：HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run\n\n    \n\n3.  **新建字符串值**：\n\n    -   右键空白处 → **新建** → **字符串值** → 名称自定义（如 `AutoRunBAT`）。\n    -   双击该值，在 **数值数据** 中填写脚本绝对路径（如 `\"C:\\Scripts\\your_script.bat\"`）。\n\n4.  重启生效。\n\n------\n\n### **方法四：组策略编辑器（专业版/企业版）**\n\n**特点**：适合企业环境集中管理。\n​**​步骤​**​：\n\n1.  按 `Win + R`，输入 `gpedit.msc` 回车。\n2.  导航到路径：计算机配置 → Windows 设置 → 脚本（启动/关机）\n3.  **双击「启动」** → **添加** → 浏览选择你的 `.bat` 文件。\n4.  重启生效。\n\n\n\n## Microsoft Visual C++ Redistributable\n\nMicrosoft Visual C++ 2008 Redistributable:\n<https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=26368>\n\nMicrosoft Visual C++ 2010 Redistributable:\n<https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=26999>\n\nMicrosoft Visual C++ 2012 Redistributable:\n<https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=30679>\n\nMicrosoft Visual C++ 2013 Redistributable:\n<https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=40784>\n\nMicrosoft Visual C++ 2015/2017/2019 Redistributable:\n<https://support.microsoft.com/zh-cn/help/2977003/the-latest-supported-visual-c-downloads>\n\n在 64 位平台上，请下载并安装 vcredist_x64.exe。\n在 32 位平台上，请下载并安装 vcredist_x86.exe。\n","slug":"操作系统/Windows/Windows 常见问题","published":true,"updated":"2024-08-21T16:00:00.000Z","_id":"cmcg7o5x2000yprqb25c839py","comments":true,"layout":"post","photos":[],"html":"<h2 id=\"Windows-清理\"><a href=\"#Windows-清理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Windows 清理\"></a>Windows 清理</h2><h3 id=\"清理-WinSxS-文件夹\"><a href=\"#清理-WinSxS-文件夹\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"清理 WinSxS 文件夹\"></a>清理 WinSxS 文件夹</h3><p>在powershell窗口中输入命令：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight powershell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">dism.exe /online /Cleanup<span class=\"literal\">-Image</span> /StartComponentCleanup</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"让英文文件夹显示的是中文名称\"><a href=\"#让英文文件夹显示的是中文名称\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"让英文文件夹显示的是中文名称\"></a>让英文文件夹显示的是中文名称</h2><p>desktop.ini 文件配置：</p>\n<p>[.ShellClassInfo]<br>LocalizedResourceName&#x3D;公共</p>\n<p>在上层文件夹中用cmd执行“attrib +s 文件夹名称”</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight cmd\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">attrib</span> +s 文件夹名称</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"删除启动项\"><a href=\"#删除启动项\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"删除启动项\"></a>删除启动项</h2><figure class=\"highlight cmd\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"># 命令 BCDEDIT</span><br><span class=\"line\">Windows 启动管理器</span><br><span class=\"line\">--------------------</span><br><span class=\"line\">标识符                  &#123;bootmgr&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">device                  partition=\\Device\\HarddiskVolume9</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">path</span>                    \\EFI\\Microsoft\\Boot\\bootmgfw.efi</span><br><span class=\"line\">description             Windows Boot Manager</span><br><span class=\"line\">locale                  zh-CN</span><br><span class=\"line\">inherit                 &#123;globalsettings&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">default                 &#123;current&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">resumeobject            &#123;<span class=\"number\">907</span>d43ff-<span class=\"number\">8158</span>-<span class=\"number\">11</span>ef-<span class=\"number\">88</span>fc-bf160908ff95&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">displayorder            &#123;current&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">                        &#123;<span class=\"number\">88888866</span>-<span class=\"number\">7880</span>-<span class=\"number\">46</span>de-<span class=\"number\">8439</span>-<span class=\"number\">4</span>fc3d0fb4ce6&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">toolsdisplayorder       &#123;memdiag&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">timeout                 <span class=\"number\">30</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">Windows 启动加载器</span><br><span class=\"line\">-------------------</span><br><span class=\"line\">标识符                  &#123;current&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">device                  partition=C:</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">path</span>                    \\Windows\\system32\\winload.efi</span><br><span class=\"line\">description             Windows <span class=\"number\">10</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">locale                  zh-CN</span><br><span class=\"line\">inherit                 &#123;bootloadersettings&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">recoverysequence        &#123;<span class=\"number\">5</span>b7a3d51-<span class=\"number\">03</span>d5-<span class=\"number\">11</span>ef-<span class=\"number\">95</span>bc-d36910f8673c&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">displaymessageoverride  Recovery</span><br><span class=\"line\">recoveryenabled         Yes</span><br><span class=\"line\">isolatedcontext         Yes</span><br><span class=\"line\">allowedinmemorysettings <span class=\"number\">0</span>x15000075</span><br><span class=\"line\">osdevice                partition=C:</span><br><span class=\"line\">systemroot              \\Windows</span><br><span class=\"line\">resumeobject            &#123;<span class=\"number\">5</span>b7a3d4f-<span class=\"number\">03</span>d5-<span class=\"number\">11</span>ef-<span class=\"number\">95</span>bc-d36910f8673c&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">nx                      OptIn</span><br><span class=\"line\">bootmenupolicy          Standard</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">Windows 启动加载器</span><br><span class=\"line\">-------------------</span><br><span class=\"line\">标识符                  &#123;<span class=\"number\">88888866</span>-<span class=\"number\">7880</span>-<span class=\"number\">46</span>de-<span class=\"number\">8439</span>-<span class=\"number\">4</span>fc3d0fb4ce6&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">device                  ramdisk=[C:]\\WEPE\\WEPE64.WIM,&#123;<span class=\"number\">888885</span>bd-e62a-<span class=\"number\">4</span>d9f-b133-f2551f11e866&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">path</span>                    \\windows\\system32\\boot\\winload.efi</span><br><span class=\"line\">description             微 PE 工具箱</span><br><span class=\"line\">osdevice                ramdisk=[C:]\\WEPE\\WEPE64.WIM,&#123;<span class=\"number\">888885</span>bd-e62a-<span class=\"number\">4</span>d9f-b133-f2551f11e866&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">systemroot              \\windows</span><br><span class=\"line\">nx                      OptIn</span><br><span class=\"line\">pae                     ForceEnable</span><br><span class=\"line\">detecthal               Yes</span><br><span class=\"line\">winpe                   Yes</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>删除启动项</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight cmd\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">bcdedit /delete &#123;<span class=\"number\">907</span>d4400-<span class=\"number\">8158</span>-<span class=\"number\">11</span>ef-<span class=\"number\">88</span>fc-bf160908ff95&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"怎么开机就执行-bat-文件\"><a href=\"#怎么开机就执行-bat-文件\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"怎么开机就执行 bat 文件\"></a>怎么开机就执行 bat 文件</h2><h3 id=\"方法一：将脚本放入「启动」文件夹\"><a href=\"#方法一：将脚本放入「启动」文件夹\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"方法一：将脚本放入「启动」文件夹\"></a><strong>方法一：将脚本放入「启动」文件夹</strong></h3><p><strong>特点</strong>：简单快捷，但需用户登录后执行。<br>​<strong>​步骤​</strong>​：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>打开启动文件夹</strong>：<ul>\n<li>按 <code>Win + R</code>，输入 <code>shell:startup</code> 回车</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>创建脚本快捷方式</strong>：<ul>\n<li>将你的 <code>.bat</code> 文件<strong>复制</strong>到该文件夹，或右键选择「新建快捷方式」。</li>\n<li>若需管理员权限，右键快捷方式 → <strong>属性</strong> → <strong>高级</strong> → 勾选 <strong>用管理员身份运行</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"方法二：通过任务计划程序\"><a href=\"#方法二：通过任务计划程序\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"方法二：通过任务计划程序\"></a><strong>方法二：通过任务计划程序</strong></h3><p><strong>特点</strong>：可设置开机自动执行（无需登录）、管理员权限、后台静默运行。<br>​<strong>​步骤​</strong>​：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>打开任务计划程序</strong>：<ul>\n<li>按 <code>Win + R</code>，输入 <code>taskschd.msc</code> 回车。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>创建新任务</strong>：<ul>\n<li>右侧点击 <strong>创建任务</strong> → 输入名称（如 <code>AutoRun BAT</code>）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>设置触发器</strong>：<ul>\n<li><strong>新建</strong> → 选择 <strong>登录时</strong> 或 <strong>启动时</strong>（启动时需管理员权限）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>设置操作</strong>：<ul>\n<li><strong>新建</strong> → 操作选择 <strong>启动程序</strong> → 浏览选择你的 <code>.bat</code> 文件。</li>\n<li>若需隐藏窗口：添加参数 <code>cmd /c &quot;你的脚本.bat&quot;</code>，并在 <strong>起始于</strong> 填写脚本所在目录。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>配置权限</strong>：<ul>\n<li><strong>常规</strong> → 勾选 <strong>不管用户是否登录都要运行</strong> 和 <strong>使用最高权限</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>保存任务</strong> → 重启测试。</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"方法三：修改注册表\"><a href=\"#方法三：修改注册表\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"方法三：修改注册表\"></a><strong>方法三：修改注册表</strong></h3><p><strong>特点</strong>：直接写入系统启动项，但需谨慎操作。<br>​<strong>​步骤​</strong>​：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p>按 <code>Win + R</code>，输入 <code>regedit</code> 回车。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>导航到注册表路径：HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>新建字符串值</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>右键空白处 → <strong>新建</strong> → <strong>字符串值</strong> → 名称自定义（如 <code>AutoRunBAT</code>）。</li>\n<li>双击该值，在 <strong>数值数据</strong> 中填写脚本绝对路径（如 <code>&quot;C:\\Scripts\\your_script.bat&quot;</code>）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>重启生效。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"方法四：组策略编辑器（专业版-企业版）\"><a href=\"#方法四：组策略编辑器（专业版-企业版）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"方法四：组策略编辑器（专业版&#x2F;企业版）\"></a><strong>方法四：组策略编辑器（专业版&#x2F;企业版）</strong></h3><p><strong>特点</strong>：适合企业环境集中管理。<br>​<strong>​步骤​</strong>​：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>按 <code>Win + R</code>，输入 <code>gpedit.msc</code> 回车。</li>\n<li>导航到路径：计算机配置 → Windows 设置 → 脚本（启动&#x2F;关机）</li>\n<li><strong>双击「启动」</strong> → <strong>添加</strong> → 浏览选择你的 <code>.bat</code> 文件。</li>\n<li>重启生效。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"Microsoft-Visual-C-Redistributable\"><a href=\"#Microsoft-Visual-C-Redistributable\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Microsoft Visual C++ Redistributable\"></a>Microsoft Visual C++ Redistributable</h2><p>Microsoft Visual C++ 2008 Redistributable:<br><a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=26368\">https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=26368</a></p>\n<p>Microsoft Visual C++ 2010 Redistributable:<br><a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=26999\">https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=26999</a></p>\n<p>Microsoft Visual C++ 2012 Redistributable:<br><a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=30679\">https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=30679</a></p>\n<p>Microsoft Visual C++ 2013 Redistributable:<br><a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=40784\">https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=40784</a></p>\n<p>Microsoft Visual C++ 2015&#x2F;2017&#x2F;2019 Redistributable:<br><a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/zh-cn/help/2977003/the-latest-supported-visual-c-downloads\">https://support.microsoft.com/zh-cn/help/2977003/the-latest-supported-visual-c-downloads</a></p>\n<p>在 64 位平台上，请下载并安装 vcredist_x64.exe。<br>在 32 位平台上，请下载并安装 vcredist_x86.exe。</p>\n","excerpt":"","more":"<h2 id=\"Windows-清理\"><a href=\"#Windows-清理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Windows 清理\"></a>Windows 清理</h2><h3 id=\"清理-WinSxS-文件夹\"><a href=\"#清理-WinSxS-文件夹\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"清理 WinSxS 文件夹\"></a>清理 WinSxS 文件夹</h3><p>在powershell窗口中输入命令：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight powershell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">dism.exe /online /Cleanup<span class=\"literal\">-Image</span> /StartComponentCleanup</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"让英文文件夹显示的是中文名称\"><a href=\"#让英文文件夹显示的是中文名称\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"让英文文件夹显示的是中文名称\"></a>让英文文件夹显示的是中文名称</h2><p>desktop.ini 文件配置：</p>\n<p>[.ShellClassInfo]<br>LocalizedResourceName&#x3D;公共</p>\n<p>在上层文件夹中用cmd执行“attrib +s 文件夹名称”</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight cmd\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">attrib</span> +s 文件夹名称</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"删除启动项\"><a href=\"#删除启动项\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"删除启动项\"></a>删除启动项</h2><figure class=\"highlight cmd\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"># 命令 BCDEDIT</span><br><span class=\"line\">Windows 启动管理器</span><br><span class=\"line\">--------------------</span><br><span class=\"line\">标识符                  &#123;bootmgr&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">device                  partition=\\Device\\HarddiskVolume9</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">path</span>                    \\EFI\\Microsoft\\Boot\\bootmgfw.efi</span><br><span class=\"line\">description             Windows Boot Manager</span><br><span class=\"line\">locale                  zh-CN</span><br><span class=\"line\">inherit                 &#123;globalsettings&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">default                 &#123;current&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">resumeobject            &#123;<span class=\"number\">907</span>d43ff-<span class=\"number\">8158</span>-<span class=\"number\">11</span>ef-<span class=\"number\">88</span>fc-bf160908ff95&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">displayorder            &#123;current&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">                        &#123;<span class=\"number\">88888866</span>-<span class=\"number\">7880</span>-<span class=\"number\">46</span>de-<span class=\"number\">8439</span>-<span class=\"number\">4</span>fc3d0fb4ce6&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">toolsdisplayorder       &#123;memdiag&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">timeout                 <span class=\"number\">30</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">Windows 启动加载器</span><br><span class=\"line\">-------------------</span><br><span class=\"line\">标识符                  &#123;current&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">device                  partition=C:</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">path</span>                    \\Windows\\system32\\winload.efi</span><br><span class=\"line\">description             Windows <span class=\"number\">10</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">locale                  zh-CN</span><br><span class=\"line\">inherit                 &#123;bootloadersettings&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">recoverysequence        &#123;<span class=\"number\">5</span>b7a3d51-<span class=\"number\">03</span>d5-<span class=\"number\">11</span>ef-<span class=\"number\">95</span>bc-d36910f8673c&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">displaymessageoverride  Recovery</span><br><span class=\"line\">recoveryenabled         Yes</span><br><span class=\"line\">isolatedcontext         Yes</span><br><span class=\"line\">allowedinmemorysettings <span class=\"number\">0</span>x15000075</span><br><span class=\"line\">osdevice                partition=C:</span><br><span class=\"line\">systemroot              \\Windows</span><br><span class=\"line\">resumeobject            &#123;<span class=\"number\">5</span>b7a3d4f-<span class=\"number\">03</span>d5-<span class=\"number\">11</span>ef-<span class=\"number\">95</span>bc-d36910f8673c&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">nx                      OptIn</span><br><span class=\"line\">bootmenupolicy          Standard</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">Windows 启动加载器</span><br><span class=\"line\">-------------------</span><br><span class=\"line\">标识符                  &#123;<span class=\"number\">88888866</span>-<span class=\"number\">7880</span>-<span class=\"number\">46</span>de-<span class=\"number\">8439</span>-<span class=\"number\">4</span>fc3d0fb4ce6&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">device                  ramdisk=[C:]\\WEPE\\WEPE64.WIM,&#123;<span class=\"number\">888885</span>bd-e62a-<span class=\"number\">4</span>d9f-b133-f2551f11e866&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">path</span>                    \\windows\\system32\\boot\\winload.efi</span><br><span class=\"line\">description             微 PE 工具箱</span><br><span class=\"line\">osdevice                ramdisk=[C:]\\WEPE\\WEPE64.WIM,&#123;<span class=\"number\">888885</span>bd-e62a-<span class=\"number\">4</span>d9f-b133-f2551f11e866&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">systemroot              \\windows</span><br><span class=\"line\">nx                      OptIn</span><br><span class=\"line\">pae                     ForceEnable</span><br><span class=\"line\">detecthal               Yes</span><br><span class=\"line\">winpe                   Yes</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>删除启动项</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight cmd\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">bcdedit /delete &#123;<span class=\"number\">907</span>d4400-<span class=\"number\">8158</span>-<span class=\"number\">11</span>ef-<span class=\"number\">88</span>fc-bf160908ff95&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"怎么开机就执行-bat-文件\"><a href=\"#怎么开机就执行-bat-文件\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"怎么开机就执行 bat 文件\"></a>怎么开机就执行 bat 文件</h2><h3 id=\"方法一：将脚本放入「启动」文件夹\"><a href=\"#方法一：将脚本放入「启动」文件夹\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"方法一：将脚本放入「启动」文件夹\"></a><strong>方法一：将脚本放入「启动」文件夹</strong></h3><p><strong>特点</strong>：简单快捷，但需用户登录后执行。<br>​<strong>​步骤​</strong>​：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>打开启动文件夹</strong>：<ul>\n<li>按 <code>Win + R</code>，输入 <code>shell:startup</code> 回车</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>创建脚本快捷方式</strong>：<ul>\n<li>将你的 <code>.bat</code> 文件<strong>复制</strong>到该文件夹，或右键选择「新建快捷方式」。</li>\n<li>若需管理员权限，右键快捷方式 → <strong>属性</strong> → <strong>高级</strong> → 勾选 <strong>用管理员身份运行</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"方法二：通过任务计划程序\"><a href=\"#方法二：通过任务计划程序\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"方法二：通过任务计划程序\"></a><strong>方法二：通过任务计划程序</strong></h3><p><strong>特点</strong>：可设置开机自动执行（无需登录）、管理员权限、后台静默运行。<br>​<strong>​步骤​</strong>​：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>打开任务计划程序</strong>：<ul>\n<li>按 <code>Win + R</code>，输入 <code>taskschd.msc</code> 回车。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>创建新任务</strong>：<ul>\n<li>右侧点击 <strong>创建任务</strong> → 输入名称（如 <code>AutoRun BAT</code>）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>设置触发器</strong>：<ul>\n<li><strong>新建</strong> → 选择 <strong>登录时</strong> 或 <strong>启动时</strong>（启动时需管理员权限）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>设置操作</strong>：<ul>\n<li><strong>新建</strong> → 操作选择 <strong>启动程序</strong> → 浏览选择你的 <code>.bat</code> 文件。</li>\n<li>若需隐藏窗口：添加参数 <code>cmd /c &quot;你的脚本.bat&quot;</code>，并在 <strong>起始于</strong> 填写脚本所在目录。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>配置权限</strong>：<ul>\n<li><strong>常规</strong> → 勾选 <strong>不管用户是否登录都要运行</strong> 和 <strong>使用最高权限</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>保存任务</strong> → 重启测试。</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"方法三：修改注册表\"><a href=\"#方法三：修改注册表\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"方法三：修改注册表\"></a><strong>方法三：修改注册表</strong></h3><p><strong>特点</strong>：直接写入系统启动项，但需谨慎操作。<br>​<strong>​步骤​</strong>​：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p>按 <code>Win + R</code>，输入 <code>regedit</code> 回车。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>导航到注册表路径：HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>新建字符串值</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>右键空白处 → <strong>新建</strong> → <strong>字符串值</strong> → 名称自定义（如 <code>AutoRunBAT</code>）。</li>\n<li>双击该值，在 <strong>数值数据</strong> 中填写脚本绝对路径（如 <code>&quot;C:\\Scripts\\your_script.bat&quot;</code>）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>重启生效。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"方法四：组策略编辑器（专业版-企业版）\"><a href=\"#方法四：组策略编辑器（专业版-企业版）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"方法四：组策略编辑器（专业版&#x2F;企业版）\"></a><strong>方法四：组策略编辑器（专业版&#x2F;企业版）</strong></h3><p><strong>特点</strong>：适合企业环境集中管理。<br>​<strong>​步骤​</strong>​：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>按 <code>Win + R</code>，输入 <code>gpedit.msc</code> 回车。</li>\n<li>导航到路径：计算机配置 → Windows 设置 → 脚本（启动&#x2F;关机）</li>\n<li><strong>双击「启动」</strong> → <strong>添加</strong> → 浏览选择你的 <code>.bat</code> 文件。</li>\n<li>重启生效。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"Microsoft-Visual-C-Redistributable\"><a href=\"#Microsoft-Visual-C-Redistributable\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Microsoft Visual C++ Redistributable\"></a>Microsoft Visual C++ Redistributable</h2><p>Microsoft Visual C++ 2008 Redistributable:<br><a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=26368\">https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=26368</a></p>\n<p>Microsoft Visual C++ 2010 Redistributable:<br><a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=26999\">https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=26999</a></p>\n<p>Microsoft Visual C++ 2012 Redistributable:<br><a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=30679\">https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=30679</a></p>\n<p>Microsoft Visual C++ 2013 Redistributable:<br><a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=40784\">https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/download/details.aspx?id=40784</a></p>\n<p>Microsoft Visual C++ 2015&#x2F;2017&#x2F;2019 Redistributable:<br><a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/zh-cn/help/2977003/the-latest-supported-visual-c-downloads\">https://support.microsoft.com/zh-cn/help/2977003/the-latest-supported-visual-c-downloads</a></p>\n<p>在 64 位平台上，请下载并安装 vcredist_x64.exe。<br>在 32 位平台上，请下载并安装 vcredist_x86.exe。</p>\n","path":"2024/08/操作系统/Windows/Windows 常见问题/","permalink":"http://example.com/2024/08/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/Windows/Windows%20%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98/","tags":[{"name":"操作系统","_id":"cmcg7o5xu002jprqbccb5hjwe","slug":"操作系统","path":"tags/操作系统/","permalink":"http://example.com/tags/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/","length":5},{"name":"Windows","_id":"cmcg7o5xw002tprqb067wc0a7","slug":"Windows","path":"tags/Windows/","permalink":"http://example.com/tags/Windows/","length":2}],"categories":[],"prev":{"title":"软件测试工具","date":"2024-09-04T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"","slug":"软件测试/小专栏/软件测试工具","published":true,"updated":"2024-09-04T16:00:00.000Z","_id":"cmcg7o5xg001mprqbamwra4bz","layout":"post","photos":[],"excerpt":"","path":"2024/09/软件测试/小专栏/软件测试工具/","permalink":"http://example.com/2024/09/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95/%E5%B0%8F%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/","__post":true},"next":{"title":"Locust 性能测试","date":"2024-08-04T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"","slug":"软件测试/性能测试/性能测试 Locust","published":true,"updated":"2024-08-04T16:00:00.000Z","_id":"cmcg7o5xi001sprqbd1kl8w3m","layout":"post","photos":[],"excerpt":"","path":"2024/08/软件测试/性能测试/性能测试 Locust/","permalink":"http://example.com/2024/08/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95/%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95/%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%20Locust/","__post":true},"__post":true}